kely will be the time of her second naltrexone injection.\n\nRecommend upgrading influenza vaccination and Shingrix #2, she defers this.\n\nINSTRUCTIONS\n\nCall the clinic with any questions. Make follow up appointment week of June 14th.\n\n#############################\n\n\n###Response A:\n{{ [doctor] hi, amanda. how are you?\n[patient] hi, how are you?\n[doctor] good. so i see that you\'re here for a follow up for your hypertension. and also for your alcohol use disorder. how are you doing?\n[patient] i\'m doing okay.\n[doctor] okay. well, let\'s talk a little bit about your blood pressure. you know that we were checking your blood pressure last time and it was running a little high. we were seeing some numbers around 150 over 100. so i put you on some medicine to help lower that. and you were taking the lisinopril 20 milligrams once a day and the hydrochlorothiazide 12.5 milligrams once a day. how are you feeling with that?\n[patient] i\'m feeling okay.\n[doctor] okay. and i know you\'ve been checking your blood pressure at home. how\'s it been running?\n[patient] it\'s been running around 135 to 145 over 95 to 110.\n[doctor] okay. and are you taking the medicine?\n[patient] i was taking the medicine, but i\'ve been having some side effects.\n[doctor] okay. what kind of side effects?\n[patient] i\'ve had headaches, i\'ve had this kind of like, "swooshing" in my left ear, and i\'ve been feeling really lethargic.\n[doctor] okay. how often are you taking the medicine?\n[patient] i\'ve been taking it once a day.\n[doctor] okay. and you\'re saying you\'re having headaches, this kind of "swooshing" in your ear, and you\'re feeling lethargic. did you take the full dose or did you cut back?\n[patient] i took half a dose and then i stopped.\n[doctor] okay. and then you stopped taking it?\n[patient] yeah.\n[doctor] okay. and when you were taking the half dose, did the side effects go away?\n[patient] yeah, they did.\n[doctor] okay. well, i think we can try to get you back 