e some positive straight leg raise\n[patient] okay\n[doctor] and your strength is equal bilaterally\n[patient] okay\n[doctor] all right and i did review your x-rays of the lumbar spine and those did not show any signs of a fracture\n[patient] okay\n[doctor] all right so i\'m gon na go ahead and assess you for low back pain\n[patient] okay\n[doctor] possible acute disc herniation\n[patient] okay\n[doctor] and i\'m gon na go ahead and prescribe you some meloxicam fifteen milligrams and you can continue with the physical therapy and i\'m gon na go ahead and refer you for a repeat mri of the lumbar spine\n[patient] okay\n[doctor] and i\'m gon na go ahead and prescribe you a physical therapy referral for that\n[patient] okay\n[doctor] all right so i know you mentioned you had a knee replacement a couple of years ago\n[patient] yeah i had a right knee arthroplasty in the spring of twenty twenty\n[doctor] okay and how are you doing with that\n[patient] i\'m doing good i\'m feeling ninety five percent improved since the surgery\n[doctor] okay all right well i\'m gon na go ahead and go over some of the results of your physical exam and your x-rays and let you know what i\'m gon na do for you\n[patient] okay\n[doctor] so i\'m gon na go ahead and order an mri of the lumbar spine\n[patient] okay\n[doctor] and i\'m gon na go ahead and prescribe you some meloxicam fifteen milligrams and you can continue with the physical therapy\n[patient] okay\n[doctor] and i\'m gon na go ahead and refer you for a repeat mri of the lumbar spine\n[patient] okay\n[doctor] all right so let\'s go ahead and get you all set up and we\'ll get you on the road to recovery\n[patient] okay\n[doctor] all right so i\'m gon na go ahead and get the nurse to come in and we\'ll get you all set up with the prescription and the physical therapy referral\n[patient] okay\n[doctor] all right so let\'s go ahead and get you all set up and we\'ll get you on the road to recovery\n[patient] okay\n[doctor] all right\n[pati