e back pain\n[doctor] okay let\'s talk a little bit about your medical history any history of diabetes\n[patient] yes i do have diabetes\n[doctor] okay and how are you managing that\n[patient] i\'m managing it pretty well i just started taking metformin\n[doctor] okay and how often do you take the metformin\n[patient] i take it twice a day\n[doctor] twice a day okay and how long have you been taking it\n[patient] i think it\'s been about a month now\n[doctor] okay and how has that been working for you\n[patient] it\'s been working good\n[doctor] okay good to hear and do you have any other medical problems besides the diabetes and the back pain\n[patient] no i don\'t have any other medical problems\n[doctor] okay and what do you do for a living\n[patient] i work at the family bakery\n[doctor] okay that\'s great i love bakery\'s i\'m a big fan of bakery\'s do you like working at the bakery\n[patient] yeah i love it i love baking\n[doctor] okay that\'s great\n[patient] yeah\n[doctor] and do you have any other hobbies outside of working at the bakery\n[patient] no i like to watch tv and hang out with my family\n[doctor] okay that sounds good\n[patient] yeah\n[doctor] and do you have any family history of diabetes\n[patient] yes my mom has diabetes\n[doctor] okay okay and any other family history of medical problems\n[patient] my grandmother had heart problems\n[doctor] okay okay\n[patient] and my uncle had a stroke\n[doctor] okay okay and do you smoke or drink\n[patient] no i don\'t smoke or drink\n[doctor] okay and do you use any recreational drugs\n[patient] no i don\'t use any drugs\n[doctor] okay okay\n[patient] no\n[doctor] okay and let\'s talk a little bit about your back pain so you said you\'re having some back pain can you tell me a little bit more about that\n[patient] yeah i\'ve been having some pain in my back\n[doctor] okay and where exactly is the pain\n[patient] it\'s in my lower back\n[doctor] okay and how long have you been having this pain\n[patient] i